# Probability on the mixer and the effects pages after PERFORM (wip204): hold a step (a white key) and turn
# SELECT: its chance, as on SEQ and the voice pages. Without a step held, SELECT still changes the page.
# PERFORM keeps its own keys (mute pads): untouched.
wait 300
expect part 0
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
expect hit0.0.0 1
# the mixer (GLO, 1st press)
tap GLO   # wip290: 1st press = VEL
expect view 15
tap GLO
expect view 3
key w0 down
turn SELECT -10
key w0 up
expect laneval6.0.0.0 50
expect view 3
expect lanes 1
# FX: MIX (first press), PERFORM, REVERB
tap FX
tap FX
expect view 2
expect fxpage 0
# wip223: HOLD FX = REVERB
press FX
wait 700
release FX
wait 100
expect fxpage 1
key w1 down
turn SELECT -19
key w1 up
expect laneval6.0.0.1 5
expect fxpage 1
expect lanes 1
# no step held: SELECT moves the page as before
turn SELECT 1
expect fxpage 2
# DELAY: back to 100 % on step 1 (still the same lane for step 2)
key w0 down
turn SELECT 20
key w0 up
expect laneval6.0.0.0 255
expect fxpage 2
key w1 down
turn SELECT 30
key w1 up
expect lanes 0
